cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "geoidep" in publications use:'
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
title: 'geoidep: Download Geographic Data on Various Topics Provided and Managed by
  the Spatial Data Infrastructure of Peru'
version: 0.5.0
doi: 10.32614/CRAN.package.geoidep
abstract: 'Provides R users with easy access to official cartographic data from Peru
  across a range of topics, including society, transport, environment, agriculture,
  climate, and more. It also includes data from regional government entities and technical-scientific
  institutions, all managed by Peru''s Spatial Data Infrastructure. For more information,
  please visit: <https://www.geoidep.gob.pe/>.'
